# Legacy URL structure: before the static-export restructure (2026-08-09),
# English pages lived under the /en locale prefix. next.config.mjs redirects
# are ignored in static export, so these old URLs 404'd (serving the noindex
# 404 page) instead of redirecting. Cloudflare Pages applies this file at the
# edge, returning a 301 so Google updates the old URLs in its index.
/en / 301
/en/* /:splat 301
